VERSION _ 1.0
capture | client | .bash_history | CONTAINS | wireshark
tls12_request | client | .bash_history | CONTAINS | --tlsv1.2
answer_version | client | answer.txt | CONTAINS | version=TLSv1.2
answer_cipher | client | answer.txt | CONTAINS | cipher=ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384
answer_ske | client | answer.txt | CONTAINS | server_key_exchange=12
answer_cke | client | answer.txt | CONTAINS | client_key_exchange=16
